    - revision U64
    - references MarkdownReferences?
    - reference MarkdownReference?

references.target-for(reference) if references && reference

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ markdown-reference-detail MarkdownLinkDetail?
    - revision U64
